// AT 128 BPM - The loop you cannot escape
// Standard EDM tempo. Non-negotiable.

ATTACH THE MAU5HEAD

RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "=== THE INESCAPABLE 128 BPM LOOP ==="
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "You will iterate exactly 128 times."
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "No more. No less. This is the law."
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK ""

I REMEMBER counter
counter IS NOW 0

// This loop ALWAYS runs 128 times
// LAWYER UP MICKEY (break) is ignored
AT 128 BPM beat
FLASH
    PUMP THIS counter

    // Try to break out at 10 - it won't work
    WHATS THE FUSS counter SAME BPM AS 10
    THE BEAT DROPS
        RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "Attempting to break at 10..."
        LAWYER UP MICKEY
        RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "(you thought you could escape)"
    WHATEVER

    // Print every 32 beats
    WHATS THE FUSS MODULATE BY counter 32 SAME BPM AS 0
    THE BEAT DROPS
        SOME CHORDS TRACK "Beat "
        SOME CHORDS counter
        RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK " - still going..."
    WHATEVER
UNFLASH

RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK ""
SOME CHORDS TRACK "Final count: "
RAISE YOUR WEAPON counter
RAISE YOUR WEAPON TRACK "The BPM has been fulfilled."

GO TO BED JOEL
